ngs to make them go away.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>I lied.<br></li><li>You can stop running.<br></li><li>If you hit a rock.<br></li><li>And you die.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189650/extras/ebb872990da8794786703ef8500be4d8.poster.avif?t=1730837842\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189650/extras/ebb872990da8794786703ef8500be4d8.webm?t=1730837842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189650/extras/ebb872990da8794786703ef8500be4d8.mp4?t=1730837842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>* <i>Or if you pause the game.</i><br><br><br>Rocks are <i>life</i>.<br>Rocks are <i>death</i>.<br><strong>ROCKS ARE COOL.</strong>",
